  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Arrange the following orbitals in decreasing order of energy.</p><p>A.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />B.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />C.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />D.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>The correct option for the order is:</p>"
  },
